From: GBRUNCH <https://github.com/osakanataro/gbrunch>
Subject: [PATCH] meson: libstdc++fs is optional (libc++ / Android NDK has no such library)

Applied to linux-surface/iptsd 106f944ac097f8eb779bdfee0487d58ae853c375 (v3.1.1) by surface/build-iptsd.sh.
---
diff --git a/src/meson.build b/src/meson.build
index 07c92c0..b52280b 100644
--- a/src/meson.build
+++ b/src/meson.build
@@ -95,8 +95,8 @@ spdlog = dependency(
 	],
 )
 
-# Find libstdc++fs for older GCC
-stdcppfs = cpp.find_library('stdc++fs')
+# Find libstdc++fs for older GCC (absent with libc++: Android NDK)
+stdcppfs = cpp.find_library('stdc++fs', required: false)
 
 # Default dependencies
 default_deps = [
